{"name": "WheelMates", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and a friend answer a call for help from a professor who has mysteriously disappeared. Take control of two tiny RC cars, drive through his maze-like home laboratory, overcome oversized obstacles, and uncover the strange experiments he left behind.</p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.poster.avif?t=1787766387\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.webm?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.mp4?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every room turns the house into a playground for two tiny RC cars. Race across shelves, drift through cluttered desks, explore every location and piece together what really happened inside.</p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.poster.avif?t=1787766387\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.webm?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.mp4?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this co-op journey your progress depends on working together. Solve puzzles and overcome challenges that require communication, timing, and both players doing their part.</p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.poster.avif?t=1787766387\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.webm?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.mp4?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your RC cars with rope-swings, magnetic wheels, magnet grabs and other power-ups. Each new gadget opens up fresh way to exploration of the professor\u2019s home.</p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.poster.avif?t=1787766387\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.webm?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.mp4?t=1787766387\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The house keeps opening up as you progress. Unlock hidden rooms and move through familiar places in new ways. </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Grab a friend and race into a co-op driving adventure as two tiny RC cars. Explore the professor\u2019s home laboratory, solve puzzles across oversized locations, find hidden paths, and uncover what really happened inside.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/77c8adc4c5c11a80f0ae22633789396a0f313433/header.jpg?t=1787766387", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Co-op", "Split Screen", "3D Platformer", "Puzzle", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Firevolt", "publishers": "Firevolt", "release_date": "Sep 1, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3905450", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 January 2026 - Request Access\n\n6 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/OhT5HZDWCQA", "first_seen": 1769554800.0, "review_rank": 1339}